  "question": {
    "text": "If an unbiased die, marked with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;on its faces is thrown five times, then the probability that the product of the outcomes is positive, is :"
  },
  "options": [
